    "text": "<p>Match the following drugs with their therapeutic actions:&nbsp;</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Ranitidine</td>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antidepressant</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Nardil (Phenelzine)</td>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antibiotic</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Chloramphenicol</td>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antihistamine</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Dimetane (Brompheniramine)</td>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Antacid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>(e)</td>\t\t\t<td>Analgesic</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>"
